    "body": "The direct result discovery fallback omits generations*.json even though log-based discovery and the statistics aggregator support inference generation output. Include the same inference filename pattern so a results directory without batch .out files can produce statistics.\n\nValidation: the new CPU discovery regression fails on the baseline; both statistics utility tests pass with the fix. Black, isort and Ruff passed. GPU training was not run.\n\nReview requested: @NVIDIA/mcore-oncall. This PR is ready for review with CPU regression evidence above. Upstream runner validation remains subject to NVIDIA contributor vetting.\n",
